name isonums
category Package
revision 17362
shortdesc Display numbers in maths mode according to ISO 31-0
relocated 1
longdesc The package makes a quick hack to ziffer to display numbers in
longdesc maths mode according to ISO 31-0, regardless of input format
longdesc (European $1.235,7$ or Anglo-American $1,235.7$). The options
longdesc [euro, anglo] control the global input format. Default input
longdesc format is anglo. Documentation is included as comments to the
longdesc text source.
runfiles size=2
